    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "AI Video Subtitle & Caption Creation Tool\n\nObjective\n\nBuild an AI-powered subtitle and caption creation tool that automatically generates, edits, synchronizes, and customizes subtitles for uploaded videos.\n\nCore Workflow\n\nStep 1: Video Upload\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Users can upload a video containing spoken audio.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240The video may contain a single speaker, multiple speakers, conversations, interviews, podcasts, tutorials, or vlogs.\n\nStep 2: Language Selection\n\nBefore transcription begins, users must select the spoken language in the video.\n\nExamples:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240English (US)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240English (UK)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Spanish\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240French\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240German\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Hindi\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Kannada\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Portuguese\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Japanese\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Other supported languages\n\nThe selected language and dialect should improve transcription accuracy.\n\nStep 3: AI Speech-to-Text Transcription\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI automatically analyzes the audio.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Spoken words are converted into text with timestamps.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240The generated subtitles should be synchronized with the speaker\'s voice.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI should detect pauses, sentence breaks, and speech timing automatically.\n\nStep 4: Subtitle Timeline Generation\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Create subtitle blocks based on speech segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Each subtitle should appear and disappear at the correct time.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Maintain proper synchronization between subtitles and audio playback.\n\nEditing Features\n\nManual Subtitle Editing\n\nUsers should be able to:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Edit any subtitle text.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Correct AI transcription mistakes.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Split subtitle segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Merge subtitle segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Adjust subtitle timing manually.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add or remove subtitle blocks.\n\nReal-Time Preview\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Changes should be visible immediately.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Users can play the video and verify subtitle synchronization.\n\nSubtitle Customization\n\nText Styling\n\nUsers should be able to customize:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font family\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font size\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font color\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font weight (Bold, Regular)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Italic styling\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Text opacity\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Letter spacing\n\nBackground Styling\n\nUsers should be able to:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add background color\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add transparent background\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add text shadow\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add outline/stroke\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add glow effect\n\nPositioning\n\nUsers should be able to place subtitles:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Bottom center\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Top center\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Custom position\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Drag-and-drop placement\n\nAnimated Caption Styles\n\nProvide modern subtitle presets such as:\n\n1.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Pop Animation\n   \n   - Words pop in as spoken.\n\n2.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Karaoke Style\n   \n   - Words highlight while being spoken.\n\n3.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Bounce Effect\n   \n   - Active words bounce slightly.\n\n4.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Zoom Effect\n   \n   - Subtitle scales in smoothly.\n\n5.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Fade Effect\n   \n   - Smooth fade in/out transitions.\n\n6.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Social Media Style\n   \n   - Dynamic captions similar to TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\n\n7.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Word-by-Word Animation\n   \n   - Display words individually as they are spoken.\n\n8.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Speaker Highlight Mode\n   \n   - Highlight active speaker text.\n\nAI Features\n\nAuto Correction\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI should detect probable transcription mistakes.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Suggest corrections without automatically replacing user edits.\n\nFiller Word Detection\n\nOption to remove:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Um\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Uh\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Hmm\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Repeated words\n\nSmart Punctuation\n\nAutomatically add:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Periods\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Commas\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Question marks\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Exclamation marks\n\nSpeaker Detection\n\nFor conversations:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Identify different speakers.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Label speakers if required.\n\nExport Options\n\nUsers can export:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Video with burned-in subtitles.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240SRT subtitle file.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240VTT subtitle file.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240TXT transcript.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Caption project file for future editing.\n\nPerformance Requirements\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Fast transcription processing.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240High accuracy across multiple languages and dialects.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Smooth subtitle rendering.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Frame-accurate synchronization.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Mobile and desktop support.\n\nGoal\n\nCreate a professional AI subtitle generator that enables users to upload a video, automatically generate accurate subtitles, edit any mistakes, customize the visual appearance, apply modern animated caption effects, keep subtitles perfectly synchronized with audio, and export the final video with captions ready for social media or professional publishing."
    items {
      text: "AI Video Subtitle & Caption Creation Tool\n\nObjective\n\nBuild an AI-powered subtitle and caption creation tool that automatically generates, edits, synchronizes, and customizes subtitles for uploaded videos.\n\nCore Workflow\n\nStep 1: Video Upload\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Users can upload a video containing spoken audio.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240The video may contain a single speaker, multiple speakers, conversations, interviews, podcasts, tutorials, or vlogs.\n\nStep 2: Language Selection\n\nBefore transcription begins, users must select the spoken language in the video.\n\nExamples:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240English (US)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240English (UK)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Spanish\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240French\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240German\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Hindi\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Kannada\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Portuguese\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Japanese\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Other supported languages\n\nThe selected language and dialect should improve transcription accuracy.\n\nStep 3: AI Speech-to-Text Transcription\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI automatically analyzes the audio.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Spoken words are converted into text with timestamps.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240The generated subtitles should be synchronized with the speaker\'s voice.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI should detect pauses, sentence breaks, and speech timing automatically.\n\nStep 4: Subtitle Timeline Generation\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Create subtitle blocks based on speech segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Each subtitle should appear and disappear at the correct time.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Maintain proper synchronization between subtitles and audio playback.\n\nEditing Features\n\nManual Subtitle Editing\n\nUsers should be able to:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Edit any subtitle text.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Correct AI transcription mistakes.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Split subtitle segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Merge subtitle segments.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Adjust subtitle timing manually.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add or remove subtitle blocks.\n\nReal-Time Preview\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Changes should be visible immediately.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Users can play the video and verify subtitle synchronization.\n\nSubtitle Customization\n\nText Styling\n\nUsers should be able to customize:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font family\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font size\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font color\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Font weight (Bold, Regular)\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Italic styling\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Text opacity\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Letter spacing\n\nBackground Styling\n\nUsers should be able to:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add background color\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add transparent background\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add text shadow\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add outline/stroke\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Add glow effect\n\nPositioning\n\nUsers should be able to place subtitles:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Bottom center\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Top center\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Custom position\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Drag-and-drop placement\n\nAnimated Caption Styles\n\nProvide modern subtitle presets such as:\n\n1.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Pop Animation\n   \n   - Words pop in as spoken.\n\n2.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Karaoke Style\n   \n   - Words highlight while being spoken.\n\n3.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Bounce Effect\n   \n   - Active words bounce slightly.\n\n4.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Zoom Effect\n   \n   - Subtitle scales in smoothly.\n\n5.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Fade Effect\n   \n   - Smooth fade in/out transitions.\n\n6.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Social Media Style\n   \n   - Dynamic captions similar to TikTok, Instagram Reels, and YouTube Shorts.\n\n7.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Word-by-Word Animation\n   \n   - Display words individually as they are spoken.\n\n8.\342\201\240 \342\201\240Speaker Highlight Mode\n   \n   - Highlight active speaker text.\n\nAI Features\n\nAuto Correction\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240AI should detect probable transcription mistakes.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Suggest corrections without automatically replacing user edits.\n\nFiller Word Detection\n\nOption to remove:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Um\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Uh\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Hmm\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Repeated words\n\nSmart Punctuation\n\nAutomatically add:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Periods\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Commas\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Question marks\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Exclamation marks\n\nSpeaker Detection\n\nFor conversations:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Identify different speakers.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Label speakers if required.\n\nExport Options\n\nUsers can export:\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Video with burned-in subtitles.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240SRT subtitle file.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240VTT subtitle file.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240TXT transcript.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Caption project file for future editing.\n\nPerformance Requirements\n\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Fast transcription processing.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240High accuracy across multiple languages and dialects.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Smooth subtitle rendering.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Frame-accurate synchronization.\n\342\200\242\342\201\240  \342\201\240Mobile and desktop support.\n\nGoal\n\nCreate a professional AI subtitle generator that enables users to upload a video, automatically generate accurate subtitles, edit any mistakes, customize the visual appearance, apply modern animated caption effects, keep subtitles perfectly synchronized with audio, and export the final video with captions ready for social media or professional publishing."
    }
  }
}
