  user_input {
    user_response: "Apply the \"Bento Grid\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Bento Grid\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML below. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic.\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\\\"en\\\"><head><meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\"><meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=1024,height=768,initial-scale=1.0\\\"><script src=\\\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\\\"></script><style>body{background-color:#020617;font-family:\'Helvetica Neue\',Arial,sans-serif;height:768px;width:1024px;overflow:hidden;color:#f8fafc}.bento-card{background-color:rgba(15,23,42,0.6);border:1px solid rgba(51,65,85,0.5);border-radius:1rem;overflow:hidden;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.timeline-block{height:32px;background:rgba(59,130,246,0.3);border:1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.6);border-radius:4px;position:relative}.timeline-block::after{content:\'\';position:absolute;left:10%;right:10%;top:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.1)}.waveform-bar{width:3px;background:#475569;border-radius:1px}.active-word{color:#3b82f6;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}</style></head><body><div class=\\\"flex flex-col h-full w-full p-4 gap-4\\\"><header class=\\\"flex items-center justify-between h-12 px-2\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\"><div class=\\\"w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 rounded flex items-center justify-center\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-5 h-5 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\"><path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M7 8h10M7 12h4m1 8l-4-4H5a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h14a2 2 0 012 2v8a2 2 0 01-2 2h-3l-4 4z\\\"></path></svg></div><h1 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\\\">CaptionFlow <span class=\\\"text-slate-500 font-normal\\\">/ Startup_Pitch_V2.mp4</span></h1></div><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-4\\\"><div class=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 bg-slate-800 rounded-full text-xs font-medium\\\"><div class=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\\\"></div>AI Transcription: 100%</div><button class=\\\"px-4 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-semibold rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/20\\\">Export Final Video</button></div></header><main class=\\\"flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-6 gap-4\\\"><div class=\\\"col-span-8 row-span-4 bento-card relative bg-black flex items-center justify-center\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 opacity-40 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-blue-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent\\\"></div><div class=\\\"relative w-[600px] aspect-video bg-slate-900 rounded-lg shadow-2xl flex items-center justify-center border border-white/5\\\"><div class=\\\"absolute bottom-8 left-0 right-0 text-center\\\"><div class=\\\"inline-block px-4 py-2 text-2xl font-bold text-white drop-shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-sm rounded-lg border border-white/10\\\"><span class=\\\"opacity-60\\\">We\'re</span> <span class=\\\"active-word text-blue-400\\\">revolutionizing</span> <span>the way</span></div></div><div class=\\\"w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center border border-white/20\\\"><svg class=\\\"w-6 h-6 text-white\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 20 20\\\"><path d=\\\"M6.3 2.841A1.5 1.5 0 004 4.11v11.78a1.5 1.5 0 002.3 1.269l9.344-5.89a1.5 1.5 0 000-2.538L6.3 2.841z\\\"></path></svg></div></div><div class=\\\"absolute top-4 left-4 flex gap-2\\\"><span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-black/60 text-[10px] font-mono border border-white/10 rounded\\\">1080p</span><span class=\\\"px-2 py-1 bg-black/60 text-[10px] font-mono border border-white/10 rounded\\\">29.97 FPS</span></div></div><div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-5 bento-card\\\"><div class=\\\"p-4 border-bottom border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center bg-slate-900/50\\\"><h2 class=\\\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400\\\">Transcript Editor</h2><button class=\\\"text-xs text-blue-400 font-medium\\\">Auto-Fix AI</button></div><div class=\\\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto p-2 space-y-1\\\"><div class=\\\"p-3 bg-blue-600/10 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-lg group cursor-pointer\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-blue-400 mb-1\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono uppercase\\\">00:01.42 \342\200\224 00:03.12</span><span class=\\\"opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\\\">Edit</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-200\\\">Hello everyone, today we\'re revolutionizing the way...</p></div><div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg group cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono uppercase\\\">00:03.15 \342\200\224 00:05.80</span><span class=\\\"opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100\\\">Edit</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400\\\">how creators engage with their audience through AI.</p></div><div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg group cursor-pointer transition-colors\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-slate-500 mb-1\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono uppercase\\\">00:06.10 \342\200\224 00:08.45</span><span class=\\\"opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 text-blue-400\\\">Edit</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400\\\">Our tool automates the process of subtitle creation.</p></div><div class=\\\"p-3 hover:bg-slate-800/50 rounded-lg group cursor-pointer transition-colors border-l-2 border-amber-500/50\\\"><div class=\\\"flex justify-between text-[10px] text-amber-500 mb-1\\\"><span class=\\\"font-mono uppercase\\\">00:08.50 \342\200\224 00:10.20</span><span class=\\\"text-amber-500\\\">Suggestion: Remove \\\"um\\\"</span></div><p class=\\\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400 italic\\\">And um, it also supports over fifty languages.</p></div></div></div><div class=\\\"col-span-4 row-span-1 bento-card p-4 flex-row items-center gap-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-slate-950\\\"><div class=\\\"flex-1\\\"><label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase block mb-1\\\">Style Preset</label><select class=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800 border-none rounded text-xs py-2 px-2 ring-1 ring-white/10\\\"><option>Modern Social (TikTok)</option><option>Professional Documentary</option><option>Karaoke Focus</option></select></div><div class=\\\"flex-1\\\"><label class=\\\"text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-500 uppercase block mb-1\\\">Animation</label><select class=\\\"w-full bg-slate-800 border-none rounded text-xs py-2 px-2 ring-1 ring-white/10\\\"><option>Pop-In (Word by Word)</option><option>Smooth Fade</option><option>Slide Up</option></select></div></div>